From: nuubOS Project <noreply@nuubos.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: sun4i-codec: disable speaker on headphone insertion

Mute the speaker path when the headphone jack is active so headphone and speaker outputs are not driven simultaneously.

Signed-off-by: nuubOS Project <noreply@nuubos.invalid>
---
diff --git a/sound/soc/sunxi/sun4i-codec.c b/sound/soc/sunxi/sun4i-codec.c
--- a/sound/soc/sunxi/sun4i-codec.c
+++ b/sound/soc/sunxi/sun4i-codec.c
@@ -1589,6 +1589,7 @@ static struct snd_soc_jack sun4i_headphone_jack;

 static struct snd_soc_jack_pin sun4i_headphone_jack_pins[] = {
 	{ .pin = "Headphone", .mask = SND_JACK_HEADPHONE },
+	{ .pin = "Speaker", .mask = SND_JACK_HEADPHONE, .invert = 1 },
 };

 static struct snd_soc_jack_gpio sun4i_headphone_jack_gpio = {
